; Local EOS credentials. Copy this file to WindowsEngine.ini (gitignored) and fill in the values from
; the Epic Developer Portal (see Docs/EOS_SETUP.md). It is layered into the Windows Engine config and
; packaged with Windows builds. Nothing here is used until EOS is enabled (phase 7).

